@startuml Activity Diagram - Edit Exercise Item Transaction
title Activity Diagram: Edit Exercise Item Transaction

|#LightBlue|Teacher|
start
:Teacher navigates to exercise list;
:Select specific exercise to edit;
:Click "Edit" button;

|#LightGreen|Frontend|
:Show loading state;
:Send GET request to /api/exercises/{exerciseId};

|#LightCoral|Backend API|
:Receive fetch exercise request;
:Validate exercise ID;
:Authenticate teacher;

if (Authentication valid?) then (No)
  :Return 401 Unauthorized;
  |#LightGreen|Frontend|
  :Display auth error;
  stop
else (Yes)
endif

if (Exercise exists?) then (No)
  :Return 404 Not Found;
  |#LightGreen|Frontend|
  :Display "Exercise not found";
  stop
else (Yes)
endif

|#LightYellow|Database|
:Query exercise details;
:Query exercise options (if Multiple Choice);
:Query exercise media files;
:Return exercise data;

|#LightCoral|Backend API|
:Return 200 OK with exercise data;

|#LightGreen|Frontend|
:Hide loading state;
:Populate edit form with existing data;

|#LightBlue|Teacher|
:Review current exercise details;

if (Exercise Type?) then (Multiple Choice)
  :Edit exercise title (optional);
  :Modify question text (optional);
  :Update answer options (optional);
  :Change correct answer (optional);
  :Adjust difficulty level (optional);
else (Execution)
  :Edit exercise title (optional);
  :Modify instruction text (optional);
  :Replace demonstration video (optional);
  :Update expected gesture/sign (optional);
  :Adjust difficulty level (optional);
endif

:Review modified details;

if (Any changes made?) then (No)
  :Display "No changes detected";
  :Option to cancel or continue;
  
  if (Teacher choice?) then (Cancel)
    stop
  else (Continue)
  endif
else (Yes)
endif

:Submit exercise update request;

|#LightGreen|Frontend|
:Validate modified form data;
:Show loading state;
:Send PUT request to /api/exercises/{exerciseId};

|#LightCoral|Backend API|
:Receive update exercise request;
:Validate request data;
:Authenticate teacher;

if (Authentication valid?) then (No)
  :Return 401 Unauthorized;
  |#LightGreen|Frontend|
  :Display auth error;
  stop
else (Yes)
endif

if (Teacher owns exercise?) then (No)
  :Return 403 Forbidden;
  |#LightGreen|Frontend|
  :Display permission error;
  stop
else (Yes)
endif

if (Data validation passed?) then (No)
  :Return 400 Bad Request;
  |#LightGreen|Frontend|
  :Display validation errors;
  stop
else (Yes)
endif

:Process file uploads (if any new files);

if (File upload successful?) then (No)
  :Return 500 Server Error;
  |#LightGreen|Frontend|
  :Display upload error;
  stop
else (Yes)
endif

|#LightYellow|Database|
:Begin transaction;
:Update exercise record;

if (Multiple Choice?) then (Yes)
  :Delete existing options;
  :Insert updated options;
else (Execution)
  :Update execution details;
endif

if (New media files?) then (Yes)
  :Delete old media files;
  :Insert new media records;
else (No)
endif

:Update last_modified timestamp;

if (Database operation successful?) then (No)
  :Rollback transaction;
  |#LightCoral|Backend API|
  :Return 500 Server Error;
  |#LightGreen|Frontend|
  :Display update error;
  stop
else (Yes)
endif

:Commit transaction;
:Return updated exercise details;

|#LightCoral|Backend API|
:Log successful update;
:Return 200 OK with updated exercise data;

|#LightGreen|Frontend|
:Hide loading state;
:Display success message;
:Update UI with new exercise details;
:Navigate to exercise list or details;

|#LightBlue|Teacher|
:View updated exercise;
:Confirm changes were applied;
:Exercise available with modifications;

stop

@enduml